                    80D212, NSSM 92. Secret. Copies were sent to
                    the Attorney General and Chairman, Joint Chiefs of Staff.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d36-f2" n="2" xml:id="d36-f2-content">
                <p>In a memorandum to Richardson, May 8,
                        Springsteen reviewed NATO’s MBFR
                    model-building exercise and EUR’s thoughts on
                    the relevance of that exercise to the work on NSSM 92. (Ibid.)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
